      "order": 0,
      "content": "<div class=\"mm-release-marker\" data-mm-release=\"f94027611ab71565c9dfd689046bb4a24db921b97ef1453416d5acfa140ed605\" data-mm-topic=\"t-mm-06-005\" hidden></div>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8478]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: ##FFFFFF; font-family: \"Calibri Light\", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt'><strong>5. </strong></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: ##FFFFFF; font-family: \"Calibri Light\", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt'><strong>SURGICAL NERVE INJURIES:</strong></span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8479]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><u><strong>1.1 \u2013 1.9%.</strong></u></span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8480]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><u><strong>Pathophysiology:</strong></u></span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8481]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Neuropraxia:</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8482]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Ext</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>ernal</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> compression disruption of conduction system in small portion.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8483]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Axonotmesis \u2013 healing takes weeks to months:</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8484]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Profound compression or traction.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8485]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Preservation of Schwan cells.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8486]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Damage to Axon.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8487]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Take weeks to months to recover</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8488]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Neurotmesis:</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8489]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Complete nerve transection.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8490]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Both Axon + Schwan cells.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8491]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Poor prognosis </span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8492]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Surgery is required.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8493]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><u><strong>Prevention:</strong></u></span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8494]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Proper lithotomy.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8495]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Strips &amp; boots @ equal height.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8496]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Proper incision \u2013 lateral margin or rectus &amp; health.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8497]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Suturing</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> of rectus </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>sheath </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>with 1.5 of lateral margin</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>s. Separate fat from sheath as it contains ilioinguinal or iliohypogastric nerves </span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8498]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Self-retaining Cather </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>for </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>max </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>of </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>4 hours, frequently change the position.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8499]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Arm rest not beyond 90</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><sup>0</sup></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8500]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Keep </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Arm in pronated position.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8501]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><u><strong>Treatment:</strong></u></span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8502]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><em><strong>Sensory:</strong></em></span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8503]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>5 weeks </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>trial of </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>TCA, GABA </span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8504]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>No effect after </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>6m</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><sup>0</sup></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>  </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>then give </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>local anesthesia.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8505]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><em><strong>Moto</strong></em></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><em><strong>r:</strong></em></span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8506]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>10 weeks up to 4 years =&gt; physiotherapy, splinting.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8507]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><em><strong>Surgery:</strong></em></span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8508]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Times New Roman\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Rarely required except Transection type injuries.</span></p>\n<div class=\"mm-table-scroll\" role=\"region\" tabindex=\"0\"><table class=\"mm-table\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;margin-left:0pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;\"><colgroup><col style=\"width:179.8pt;\"><col style=\"width:179.85pt;\"><col style=\"width:179.85pt;\"></colgroup><tbody><tr><td style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;width:179.8pt;background-color:#B4C6E7;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;\"><p style=\"margin:0;text-align:center;margin-bottom:8pt;\">NERVE</p></td><td style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;width:179.85pt;background-color:#B4C6E7;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;\"><p style=\"margin:0;text-align:center;margin-bottom:8pt;\">PROCEDURE</p></td><td style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;width:179.85pt;background-color:#B4C6E7;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;\"><p style=\"margin:0;text-align:center;margin-bottom:8pt;\">PRESENTATION</p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;width:179.8pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;\"><p style=\"margin:0;text-align:center;margin-bottom:8pt;\"></p><p style=\"margin:0;text-align:center;margin-bottom:8pt;\">Femoral</p></td><td style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;width:179.85pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;\"><ul style=\"list-style-type:none;margin:0 0 0 36pt;padding:0;text-indent:-18pt;\"><li data-source-marker-codepoints=\"U+F0B7\" data-source-marker-font=\"Symbol\"><span class=\"list-prefix\" style=\"display:inline-flex;width:18pt;\"><span class=\"list-marker\">\u2022</span><span class=\"list-tab\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-list-suffix=\"tab\" style=\"flex:1 1 auto;min-width:0;\"></span></span>TAH</li></ul><ul style=\"list-style-type:none;margin:0 0 0 72pt;padding:0;text-indent:-18pt;\"><li data-source-marker-codepoints=\"U+002D\" data-source-marker-font=\"Calibri\"><span class=\"list-prefix\" style=\"display:inline-flex;width:18pt;\"><span class=\"list-marker\">-</span><span class=\"list-tab\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-list-suffix=\"tab\" style=\"flex:1 1 auto;min-width:0;\"></span></span>With retractor 8%.</li><li data-source-marker-codepoints=\"U+002D\" data-source-marker-font=\"Calibri\"><span class=\"list-prefix\" style=\"display:inline-flex;width:18pt;\"><span class=\"list-marker\">-</span><span class=\"list-tab\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-list-suffix=\"tab\" style=\"flex:1 1 auto;min-width:0;\"></span></span>Without 1%.</li></ul><ul style=\"list-style-type:none;margin:0 0 0 36pt;padding:0;text-indent:-18pt;\"><li data-source-marker-codepoints=\"U+F0B7\" data-source-marker-font=\"Symbol\"><span class=\"list-prefix\" style=\"display:inline-flex;width:18pt;\"><span class=\"list-marker\">\u2022</span><span class=\"list-tab\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-list-suffix=\"tab\" style=\"flex:1 1 auto;min-width:0;\"></span></span>Improper lithotomy.</li></ul></td><td style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;width:179.85pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;\"><ul style=\"list-style-type:none;margin:0 0 0 36pt;padding:0;text-indent:-18pt;\"><li data-source-marker-codepoints=\"U+F0B7\" data-source-marker-font=\"Symbol\"><span class=\"list-prefix\" style=\"display:inline-flex;width:18pt;\"><span class=\"list-marker\">\u2022</span><span class=\"list-tab\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-list-suffix=\"tab\" style=\"flex:1 1 auto;min-width:0;\"></span></span>Loss of knee Jerk</li><li data-source-marker-codepoints=\"U+F0B7\" data-source-marker-font=\"Symbol\"><span class=\"list-prefix\" style=\"display:inline-flex;width:18pt;\"><span class=\"list-marker\">\u2022</span><span class=\"list-tab\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-list-suffix=\"tab\" style=\"flex:1 1 auto;min-width:0;\"></span></span>Sensory loss @ anterior and Medial thigh.</li><li data-source-marker-codepoints=\"U+F0B7\" data-source-marker-font=\"Symbol\"><span class=\"list-prefix\" style=\"display:inline-flex;width:18pt;\"><span class=\"list-marker\">\u2022</span><span class=\"list-tab\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-list-suffix=\"tab\" style=\"flex:1 1 auto;min-width:0;\"></span></span>Unable to climb Stairs.</li></ul></td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;width:179.8pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;\"><p style=\"margin:0;text-align:center;margin-bottom:8pt;\">Ilioinguinal, iliohypogastric 3.7%</p></td><td style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;width:179.85pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;\"><p style=\"margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;\"> Pfannenstiel incision 7%</p></td><td style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;width:179.85pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;\"><p style=\"margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;\">Pain from scar to mons, labia, thigh</p><p style=\"margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;\"></p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;width:179.8pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;\"><p style=\"margin:0;tex